             -------------------------------------
              PsionMan 1.3 for the Psion Series 3  
             -------------------------------------

         Copy the file  PSIONMAN.OPA to APP directory

      Select "INSTALL APPLICATION" on the system screen

                       And then run. :)

  The program will create one small file called "Psiman.prs"
  in the OPD directory on drive M:. This may be safely deleted
  but will be re-created next time the program is run.

  The program requires approx 21k of disk space and about 20k
  of free memory to run. If you are short on memory, make
  sure you kill other large running applications.

  ----------------------------------------------------------

  Press the HELP button in the game to see available commands

  Aim: Keep him and his dog alive!

  ----------------------------------------------------------

Program inspired by "Little Computer People" released many years
            ago for the Commodore 64 (initially).

